{"chunk_id": "financial_report_q3::c001", "document_id": "financial_report_q3", "sequence": 1, "source_start": 0, "source_end": 446, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Executive Summary\n\nIn the third quarter of fiscal year 2025, GlobalTech Industries reported consolidated revenue of $847.3 million, representing a 12.4 percent year-over-year increase from $753.8 million in Q3 2024. Net income attributable to shareholders was $142.6 million, or $3.47 per diluted share, compared to $118.2 million, or $2.89 per diluted share, in the prior year period. Operating margin improved to 22.1 percent from 20.3 percent.", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 446, "source_document_hash": "0044c58e37e49c05b55288a620ce450c594d2c640962ef11988efb4b0f818cd4", "structure": {"section_ids": ["financial_report_q3#s0"], "paragraph_ids": ["financial_report_q3#s0#p1"], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
