{"chunk_id": "financial_report_q3::c003", "document_id": "financial_report_q3", "sequence": 3, "source_start": 448, "source_end": 873, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Revenue Breakdown\n\nRevenue growth was driven primarily by the Enterprise Solutions division, which posted revenue of $412.5 million (48.7 percent of total revenue), up 18.3 percent from the prior year. The Cloud Services division contributed $287.1 million (33.9 percent), growing 9.7 percent year-over-year. The Professional Services segment generated $147.7 million (17.4 percent), reflecting a modest 4.2 percent increase.", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 425, "source_document_hash": "0044c58e37e49c05b55288a620ce450c594d2c640962ef11988efb4b0f818cd4", "structure": {"section_ids": ["financial_report_q3#s1"], "paragraph_ids": ["financial_report_q3#s1#p1"], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
