{"chunk_id": "financial_report_q3::c006", "document_id": "financial_report_q3", "sequence": 6, "source_start": 1109, "source_end": 1579, "offset_resolution": "resolved", "heading_prefix_dropped": false, "text": "Operating Expenses\n\nTotal operating expenses for Q3 2025 were $660.1 million, compared to $600.7 million in Q3 2024. Research and development expenses increased 14.8 percent to $198.3 million, reflecting continued investment in artificial intelligence and machine learning capabilities. Sales and marketing expenses were $234.5 million, up 8.2 percent. General and administrative expenses were $127.3 million, and amortization of acquired intangibles was $100.0 million.", "chunker_version": "chunk-v1-legacy-chars-1000-200", "chunk_char_len": 470, "source_document_hash": "0044c58e37e49c05b55288a620ce450c594d2c640962ef11988efb4b0f818cd4", "structure": {"section_ids": ["financial_report_q3#s2"], "paragraph_ids": ["financial_report_q3#s2#p1"], "table_ids": [], "row_ids": [], "cell_ids": [], "list_ids": [], "list_item_ids": []}}
